          "For The Loan Coordinator's virtual assistant operations team: Collect on a fixed cadence and preserve the source link. A sample that only includes clean cases will overstate completeness and hide the reason codes the owner needs. Test the rule on one ordinary item, one exception, and one unresolved case before expanding it. Compare the finding with one adverse case and one reopened case before accepting it."
